ation_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"262f4d908228c75f\" href=\"?note=262f4d908228c75f\" title=\"72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction\">72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction</a> 的 PCA、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ab}_i,\\operatorname{fv}_X\">\\(\\mathsf{ab}_i,\\operatorname{fv}_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_X\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in X\">\\(a\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in X^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in X^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[i:=a]\">\\(\\eta[i:=a]\\)</span> 是仅将指标 i 更新为 a 的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_X(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t))=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}_X(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t))=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall b\\in X\\ \\bigl[E_G(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)c_a,\\eta,b)\\leftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta[i:=a],b)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall b\\in X\\ \\bigl[E_G(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)c_a,\\eta,b)\\leftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta[i:=a],b)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对项结构同时归纳。变量与常元分支由 K 及 SKK 方程；SKK a 的右式 K a (K a) 有值且为 a。应用分支先用归纳得到两个抽象项都有值，再由 S 的前两步总有值获得抽象项本身的值；第三步的弱等式将其应用于 a 的输出精确化为两个子式在更新环境下的应用。自由变量式逐构造成立。没有断言原始项 t 必须有值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"262f4d908228c75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction","status":"resolved","id":"262f4d908228c75f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] 的 PCA、$\\mathsf{ab}_i,\\operatorname{fv}_X$。$t\\in\\mathcal T_X$，$i\\in\\omega$，$a\\in X$，$\\eta\\in X^\\omega$；$\\eta[i:=a]$ 是仅将指标 i 更新为 a 的函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{ab}_i,\\operatorname{fv}_X","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in X^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[i:=a]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_X(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t))=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall b\\in X\\ \\bigl[E_G(\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)c_a,\\eta,b)\\leftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta[i:=a],b)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1766,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-re